ve it unscheduled for review.</div></div></div></div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-top:10px"><h3 style="margin:0">Staff Assignment <span class="helpDot" tabindex="0" data-tip="Shows where this staff member is listed as primary/secondary support by item. Edit Assignment changes student-staff relationships from the staff side.">?</span> <span id="staffUnsavedBadge" class="profileUnsavedBadge">Unsaved changes</span></h3><button class="btn" data-action="open-onpaper-editor">Edit Assignment</button></div><div class="muted">Day-of assignments may change after absences, time blocks, priority holds, grouping, and rescue logic.</div><div id="staffOnPaperSchedule" class="scroll" style="max-height:260px;margin-top:8px"></div><div class="stickyActions toolbar"><button class="btn primary" data-action="staff-save">Save Staff</button><button class="btn" data-action="staff-new">Clear</button></div></div></div></section>

